  // guarded: a blocked CDN (window._fbBlocked) degrades to offline mode instead of
  // throwing. After firestore init, _fbFlushReady() runs every queued _whenFirebaseReady
  // callback (the auth listeners scattered across the app) now that app/auth/db are populated.
  //
  // Auth-only boot. Fires on the (small) auth-compat onload so the signed-in account
